[mcp] Add generic GameSurface MCP tools (complete)
Files: crates/engine-observation-mcp/Cargo.toml; crates/engine-observation-mcp/src/lib.rs
Do: Extend the generic stdio server with manifest, journal read, branch open, preview append, append, compare, and discard tools. Return structured text plus PNG content where a render exists. Keep write tools explicit and revision-checked; keep observation tools usable for read-only surfaces.
Accept: `tools/list` exposes the surface tools; raw protocol tests can initialize, read metadata, open a branch, preview a fact, commit it, observe it, discard it, and observe the actual line again.
-> synthetic
