[voxel] Move voxel onto GameSurface (complete)
Files: crates/voxel-sample/src/observer.rs; crates/voxel-sample/src/bin/voxel-observer-mcp.rs; crates/voxel-sample/src/world.rs; crates/voxel-sample/README.md
Do: Replace the render-only voxel observer with a GameSurface implementation. Describe voxel facts with a package-owned schema, decode validated JSON facts, render selected histories, expose branch lifecycle, and retain the current explicit-time PNG path.
Accept: The same generic MCP tools can open a voxel counterfactual, append a validated voxel fact, render the result, discard it, and recover the actual cottage image. Invalid facts and stale revisions leave history unchanged.
